      "structure_description": "The secondary building unit is a sandwich-like Dy8Nb64 polyoxoanion: two γ-Nb32 fragments enclose two Dy4 carbonate–etidronate motifs. Each Dy4 motif contains four DyO8 polyhedra. CoO6 linkers connect adjacent building units through terminal niobate oxo atoms into a one-dimensional nanowire along the b direction; hydrogen bonding and electrostatic interactions assemble the wires into a three-dimensional supramolecular array.",
